Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound observer board opens without migration or
 creation

---
 hermes_cli/kanban_dispatch_owner.py           |  7 ++-
 hermes_cli/kanban_failed_result_observer.py   | 32 +++++++++++++-
 .../test_kanban_failed_result_connection.py   | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
